# Adding a page

1. Create `src/app/<route>/page.tsx` as a Server Component with a default export
2. Add `{ name, href, icon }` to the `links` array in `@src/components/Sidebar.tsx` so desktop and mobile nav stay in sync. `icon` must be a Material Symbols name
3. Use exact `pathname === href` matching (no prefix matching) unless the new route has nested segments that should share an active state
4. Pick a template: padded `pt-24` page (dashboard/alerts/settings) or full-bleed overlay (maps)
5. Do not wrap the page in another Sidebar/TopBar — `src/app/layout.tsx` already provides both
6. Leave weather values hardcoded unless the task explicitly adds a data source
